OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud for
OL,6,Fmany through the evening with patchy
OL,7,Fdrizzle and hill fog over the Pennines
OL,8,Fand Cheviots. Clearer spells develop
OL,9,Facross the east of the region through
OL,10,Fthe evening and overnight. Mild
OL,11,Fovernight with light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA bright start in the east,
OL,14,Fcloud and patchy light rain in the
OL,15,Fwest. Cloud builds with a light shower
OL,16,Fpossible anywhere before clearing
OL,17,Flater. Feeling warm in sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
